*> Naive Bayes classification of penguin species from a mix of numeric (Gaussian) and
*> categorical (frequency-table) predictors, with a bill-measurements-only model for plots.
*> NaiveBayesClassifier drops incomplete rows for its own formula columns when fitting.
*> CMD: just TARGET=naive_bayes_penguins_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NAIVE-BAYES-PENGUINS-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

*> The formula's columns: a row counts as complete when none of them is null.
01 COLUMN-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "species".
   05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "bill_length_mm".
   05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "bill_depth_mm".
   05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "island".
   05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "sex".
01 FORMULA-COLUMNS REDEFINES COLUMN-DATA.
   05 FORMULA-COLUMN PIC X(16) OCCURS 5.

01 PENGUINS      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MODEL         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 BILL-ONLY     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 FRAME         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PREDICTIONS   USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NROWS         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ROW           USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 C             USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 MISCLASSIFIED USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 COMPLETE      PIC X.
01 COLUMN-NAME   PIC X(16).
01 ACTUAL        PIC X(32).
01 ISLAND        PIC X(32).
01 SEX           PIC X(32).
01 BILL-LENGTH   USAGE COMP-2.
01 BILL-DEPTH    USAGE COMP-2.
01 PERCENT       USAGE COMP-2.
01 NUM-EDIT      PIC Z(8)9.
01 NUM-EDIT-2    PIC Z(8)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_penguins" USING DM-DATA-PENGUINS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-PENGUINS-RESULT TO PENGUINS
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_ncols" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE NROWS TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NCOLS-RESULT TO NUM-EDIT-2
    DISPLAY "penguins: " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) " rows x " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2) " cols"
    DISPLAY " "

    *> Each predictor is modeled independently given the class (the naive Bayes assumption).
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW-DATA
    MOVE "species ~ bill_length_mm + bill_depth_mm + island + sex"
        TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_new" USING DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO MODEL
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_print_summary" USING DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PRINT-SUMMARY
        DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Confusion matrix (rows = actual, cols = predicted):"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-SELF
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_confusion_matrix" USING
        DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-CONFUSION-MATRIX-RESULT TO FRAME
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_to_string" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    DISPLAY DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-TO-STRING-RESULT-LENGTH)
    MOVE FRAME TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "Misclassified rows:"
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-SELF
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-NEWDATA
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_predict" USING DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PREDICT-RESULT TO PREDICTIONS
    *> Copy the predicted labels into DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(1..344).
    MOVE PREDICTIONS TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-START
    CALL "dm_vector_string_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE 0 TO MISCLASSIFIED
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        PERFORM CHECK-COMPLETE
        IF COMPLETE = "Y"
            MOVE "species" TO COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM STRING-AT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO ACTUAL
            IF DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1) NOT = ACTUAL
                ADD 1 TO MISCLASSIFIED
                PERFORM PRINT-MISCLASSIFIED
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE MISCLASSIFIED TO NUM-EDIT
    MOVE NROWS TO NUM-EDIT-2
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) " misclassified (of " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT-2)
        " rows, some incomplete)"
    MOVE PREDICTIONS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    *> plot_decision_regions requires exactly two NUMERIC predictors, so a separate
    *> two-predictor model (bill measurements alone) is built just for visualization.
    MOVE "species ~ bill_length_mm + bill_depth_mm" TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_new" USING DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT TO BILL-ONLY
    MOVE BILL-ONLY TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-SELF
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_training_accuracy" USING
        DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    COMPUTE PERCENT = DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-TRAINING-ACCURACY-RESULT * 100.0
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "bill-measurements-only model training accuracy: " PERCENT "%"

    MOVE BILL-ONLY TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-SELF
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-DATA
    MOVE "bill_length_mm" TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-X-FEATURE
    MOVE "bill_depth_mm" TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-Y-FEATURE
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_plot_classification" USING
        DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "naive_bayes_penguins_classification.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT

    MOVE BILL-ONLY TO DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF
    MOVE "bill_length_mm" TO DM-NAIVE-BYS-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-X-FEATURE
    MOVE "bill_depth_mm" TO DM-NAIVE-BYS-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-Y-FEATURE
    CALL "dm_naive_bayes_classifier_plot_decision_regions" USING
        DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-NAIVE-BAYES-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "naive_bayes_penguins_decision_regions.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-PLOT
    DISPLAY "Saved naive_bayes_penguins_classification.svg and "
        "naive_bayes_penguins_decision_regions.svg"

    MOVE BILL-ONLY TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> COMPLETE gets "Y" when none of the formula's columns is null at ROW.
CHECK-COMPLETE.
    MOVE "Y" TO COMPLETE
    PERFORM VARYING C FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL C > 5
        MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-SELF
        MOVE FORMULA-COLUMN(C) TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-COLUMN-NAME
        MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-ROW-INDEX
        CALL "dm_data_frame_is_null" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        IF DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-RESULT = 1
            MOVE "N" TO COMPLETE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

*> Prints the misclassified row ROW (ACTUAL is its species).
PRINT-MISCLASSIFIED.
    MOVE "bill_length_mm" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO BILL-LENGTH
    MOVE "bill_depth_mm" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM NUMERIC-AT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO BILL-DEPTH
    MOVE "island" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM STRING-AT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO ISLAND
    MOVE "sex" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM STRING-AT
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) TO SEX
    MOVE ROW TO NUM-EDIT
    DISPLAY "  row " FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) ": bill_length=" BILL-LENGTH
        " bill_depth=" BILL-DEPTH " island=" FUNCTION TRIM(ISLAND)
        " sex=" FUNCTION TRIM(SEX) "  actual=" FUNCTION TRIM(ACTUAL)
        "  predicted=" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(ROW + 1)).

*> Reads penguins COLUMN-NAME at ROW into DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT.
STRING-AT.
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Reads penguins COLUMN-NAME at ROW into DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT.
NUMERIC-AT.
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Saves PLOT to DM-PLOT-SAVE-PATH and closes it.
SAVE-PLOT.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SELF
    CALL "dm_plot_save" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
